  "hints": [
    "First 7483: Adds A + B with Carry-In (pin 13) grounded. Call its outputs Z3 Z2 Z1 Z0 and its carry-out K.",
    "Correction detector: Cout = K OR (Z3 AND Z2) OR (Z3 AND Z1).",
    "Second 7483: A inputs = Z, B inputs = 0 Cout Cout 0 (adds 0110 when Cout = 1), Carry-In grounded.",
    "The carry-out of the second 7483 is ignored - the final Cout comes directly from the detector."
